# UI theme

Read [docs/ui-theme.md](docs/ui-theme.md). The visual guide is `/admin/theme`.

Use Tailwind tokens from `app/globals.css`: `canvas`, `surface`, `surface-raised`, `line`, `line-strong`, `ink`, `ink-muted`, `ink-faint`, `accent`, `accent-strong`, `success`, `danger`, `warning`.

Do not add new brand colours in components. A draft light scheme exists on `/admin/theme` only. Do not apply light tokens to the live site until Click accepts them.
